  "phoneMessages": [
    {
      "at": 1792574406893,
      "role": "player",
      "text": "玩家拨打工作电话，等待接听。",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "delivery": {
        "responseAction": "reply"
      },
      "messageId": "b2cc7fb2-df9a-4fab-ba3e-afbc9a1da3c4"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574408575,
      "role": "npc",
      "text": "您好，我是赵晓晨。您这会儿打电话来，是有什么事吗？",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "messageId": "d595bfe3-ac31-4e93-82af-f271d23b7d82"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574419094,
      "role": "player",
      "text": "赵老师，咱们能不能安排一次技术交流会，讨论接口需求？",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "delivery": {
        "responseAction": "reply"
      },
      "messageId": "327d8eeb-ffb6-4a99-950f-4037b83b6d2c"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574421683,
      "role": "npc",
      "text": "嗯……这个我得先记下来，跟李经理汇报一下，后面再给您回话。",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "messageId": "8a1e82c5-a5b0-4ff7-9e06-ee8a588b3581"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574440844,
      "role": "player",
      "text": "那就下周三？",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "delivery": {
        "responseAction": "reply"
      },
      "messageId": "23f87b34-431d-46d1-b672-d41ccaf90bd1"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574443973,
      "role": "npc",
      "text": "这个时间我这边定不了，得先跟李经理汇报，有结果再给您回话。",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "messageId": "e379413c-7361-4773-b682-dda7fe7a6697"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574462353,
      "role": "player",
      "text": "刚才的技术交流会先不办了，我撤回这个活动提议。",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "delivery": {
        "responseAction": "reply"
      },
      "messageId": "1f4f8f21-3b7f-4cae-b639-f2060bb445da"
    },
    {
      "at": 1792574466352,
      "role": "npc",
      "text": "嗯嗯，知道了，那这事我就先不往上报了。",
      "channel": "work_phone",
      "messageId": "cf78471f-3c16-486f-89fc-c13f76fb15b4"
    }
  ]
}